<title>USA: Culbro Corp completes purchase of Villazon.</title>
<headline>Culbro Corp completes purchase of Villazon.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Culbro Corp on Wednesday said its General Cigar subsidiary has completed the previously announced purchase of Villazon &amp; Co and its Honduran affiliate, after arranging financing through a credit facility.</p>
<p>General Cigar Holding's brands are Macanudo and Partagas. Villazon and its affiliate have Punch, Hoyo de Monterey and other brands. Culbro said the deal will be financed with funds raised through a planned General Cigar initial public offering.</p>
</text>
